.TH PO-TRANSLATE 1 "2026-02-15" "Daniel Nylander" "po-translate Manual"
.SH NAME
po-translate - Batch translate PO and TS files using AI
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B po-translate
.RI [ OPTIONS ]
.I PATHS...
.SH DESCRIPTION
\fBpo-translate\fR batch translates .po, .ts, and .xliff localization files using AI or free translation services. It supports 8 translation backends (Lingva, MyMemory, LibreTranslate, DeepL, Google, OpenAI, Anthropic), custom glossaries, placeholder preservation, and dry-run mode.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.I PATHS
Files or directories to translate.
.TP
.BR \-s ", " \-\-source " " \fILANG\fR
Source language code (e.g., en). Required.
.TP
.BR \-t ", " \-\-target " " \fILANG\fR
Target language code (e.g., sv). Defaults to system LANG.
.TP
.BR \-\-service " " \fISERVICE\fR
Translation service: lingva, mymemory, libretranslate, deepl, deepl-free, google, openai, anthropic (default: lingva).
.TP
.BR \-\-api\-key " " \fIKEY\fR
API key for paid services.
.TP
.BR \-\-url " " \fIURL\fR
Custom URL for LibreTranslate.
.TP
.BR \-\-model " " \fIMODEL\fR
Model for AI services (e.g., gpt-4o-mini, claude-3-haiku-20240307).
.TP
.BR \-\-batch\-size " " \fIN\fR
Entries per API call (default: 10).
.TP
.BR \-\-glossary " " \fIFILE\fR
CSV glossary file (source,target per line) for custom terms.
.TP
.B \-\-dry\-run
Do not save changes.
.TP
.B \-\-no\-recursive
Do not search subdirectories.
.TP
.BR \-V ", " \-\-verbose
Show detailed progress.
.TP
.BR \-v ", " \-\-version
Show version number and exit.
.TP
.B \-\-about
Show application info and exit.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
po-translate -s en -t sv messages.po
po-translate -s en --service deepl --api-key KEY translations/
po-translate -s en -t de --service openai --model gpt-4o-mini *.po
po-translate -s en --glossary terms.csv --dry-run project/
.fi
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/po-translate/
Configuration files.
.TP
.I ~/.cache/po-translate/
Cached data.
